{"title":"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Marie does three equally time-consuming tasks in a row without taking breaks. She begins the first task at 1:00 PM and finishes the second task at 2:40 PM. When does she finish the third task?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/337eec45d3da3236a2758d3a3dc4ca9d96025cc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\; \\text{3:10 PM} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\; \\text{3:30 PM} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\; \\text{4:00 PM} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\; \\text{4:10 PM} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\; \\text{4:30 PM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"609\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first two tasks took <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/c/c2c6eba4ac13f9f94163c0390866b735d33d2a74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{2:40 PM}-\\text{1:00 PM}=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"196\" height=\"13\" /> minutes. Thus, each task takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbf633539b7cfbb673bcb056e08190f4b1d6a702.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\div 2=50$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> minutes. So the third task finishes at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3ead6c03e611d4da6c2b761e5142bc857a6a86a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{2:40 PM}+50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" /> minutes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/1/5f180b5227c89209f5674a1440352a3d3d0bb53d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\fbox{\\textbf{(B)}\\; \\text{3:30 PM}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B\">2015 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?tit